      "statement": "format_validator is a deterministic zero-LLM-cost evaluator that dispatches on the format the question demands (markdown table, JSON object/array, CSV, YAML, bullets, sentences+citation) and returns a binary score with a reason; unrecognized instructions score 0 with 'no known format instruction detected'.",
