      "statement": "abstained normalizes text and matches two marker families (first-person ignorance and source-negative claims); 'dont know' alone is excluded so reported paper uncertainty is not read as refusal, the detector is English-only by design with the abstention_quality LLM judge as multilingual ground truth, and a first-person hedge inside a real answer is a known accepted false positive.",
